{"about_the_game":"Brawl of Ages is a free to play, multiplayer Collectible Card Arena game that draws elements from the most fun, exciting and competitive gameplay aspects of several different genres, including CCGs, MOBAs, RTS &amp; Tower Defense.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529840/extras/9d723925e30861bab63026e19d3362b7.avif?t=1548174766\" width=627 height=64 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced 1v1 arena battles.<br></li><li>Matchmaking &amp; Ladder rankings.<br></li><li>Full Featured Brawl Clubs (clans): Text &amp; Voice Chat, Friendly Challenge with up to 50 Club members. Compete in the Club v Club Ladder and earn extra free content together.<br></li><li>Built-in VoIP and text chat in Smash Parties where you &amp; your friends can challenge each other and compete for the bounty rewarded to the final champion.<br></li><li>Robust crafting system allowing players to directly craft the cards they desire most.<br></li><li>Gameplay modes &amp; experience that caters to both highly competitive &amp; casual gamers.</li></ul><br>Brawl of Ages was designed with several factors in mind: for all types of gamers to be able to have a fun time competing against each other in fair &amp; balanced matchups, without having to deal with some of the more recently prevalent game models that feature  power multipliers, gated content, slow &amp; painful progression, and unfair matches where their opponents could have stronger cards than them because they chose to pay for a power advantage. BoA\u2019s gameplay balance is  for the highly competitive gamer and free of any pay-to-win mechanics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529840/extras/fd364f37ce281073909a68d0867e0d8d.avif?t=1548174766\" width=594 height=234 /></span><br><br>Choose 10 cards from a large collection featuring unique &amp; exciting gameplay mechanics from some of the most popular competitive multiplayer genres. Tailor your deck to match your own personal gameplay style &amp; strategy. Challenge your opponents to 1v1 battle arenas. Use your cards to summon units, build structures and cast spells. Execute your attack strategies &amp; manage your resources with precision timing to destroy your opponent\u2019s base. With a short duration and the action gets ever more frantic, will you be the one standing victorious at the end?","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"190f3e76f84fe4cb0ddfb8488135bec0ae82c679.jpg","localized_name":"Play 5 Games","name":"Play 5 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/529840/190f3e76f84fe4cb0ddfb8488135bec0ae82c679.jpg"},{"icon":"29c1fb2bd3c88ccb602da5dd0cb2d7ffbed70d32.jpg","localized_name":"Play 10 Games","name":"Play 10 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/529840/29c1fb2bd3c88ccb602da5dd0cb2d7ffbed70d32.jpg"},{"icon":"46c1e71932574add6e5ad06b2e2043a3db8d93f2.jpg","localized_name":"Reach Conquest Level 5","name":"Reach Conquest Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/529840/46c1e71932574add6e5ad06b2e2043a3db8d93f2.jpg"},{"icon":"2298900cf1da2f26a344229f24f33756f0110555.jpg","localized_name":"Win 5 Games","name":"Win 5 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/529840/2298900cf1da2f26a344229f24f33756f0110555.jpg"},{"icon":"3b5de374409ef660ed4c83d7b3711332b22cccce.jpg","localized_name":"Win 15 Games","name":"Win 15 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/529840/3b5de374409ef660ed4c83d7b3711332b22cccce.jpg"},{"icon":"002d8f2ee13e02dcabb9e34409851362ae39b629.jpg","localized_name":"Reach 100 Medals","name":"Reach 100 Medals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/529840/002d8f2ee13e02dcabb9e3440985